===============================================================================
NOTES ON SCOPE
===============================================================================

This licence covers the SOFTWARE in this repository - the analysis scripts, the
application and the documentation.

It does NOT cover the underlying chemical data. GHS classifications were
obtained from PubChem, which aggregates them from the European Chemicals
Agency, Regulation (EC) No 1272/2008, the Hazardous Substances Data Bank,
NITE-CMC and the Hazardous Chemical Information System of Safe Work Australia.
Those records remain subject to the terms of their originating bodies. PubChem
data are in the public domain
(https://www.nlm.nih.gov/web_policies.html), but users redistributing derived
datasets should check the terms of each contributing source.

SAFETY DISCLAIMER

The models in this repository are computational screening tools. They do not
replace laboratory testing or regulatory assessment under Malaysia's
Occupational Safety and Health (Classification, Labelling and Safety Data Sheet
of Hazardous Chemicals) Regulations 2013, or under equivalent legislation in
any other jurisdiction. Predictions must not be used as the sole basis for any
decision affecting human safety.
